{"goal":"理解栈顶、入栈、出栈和后进先出。使用初始空栈，依次执行 push(3) → push(8) → pop() → push(5)，追踪每步栈内容、栈顶及出栈结果。","learner_evidence":{"evidence":{"cognitive_style":null,"engineering_preference":null,"error_preferences":null,"evidence":{"knowledge_base":[{"confidence":1,"observed_at":"2026-11-11T00:00:00+08:00","profile_version":1,"source":"learner_statement"}]},"extended_dimensions":null,"knowledge_base":{"statement":"我只掌握数组基础，这是第一次学习栈。"},"learning_goals":null,"professional_background":null},"profile_version":1,"source":"synthetic_test_profile","statement":"我只掌握数组基础，这是第一次学习栈。","version":"stack-learner-evidence-v1"},"materials":{"capacity":3,"facts":{"boundary":"容量为 3，无扩容。满栈 push 或空栈 pop 返回 false，状态不变，失败的 pop 不写 *out。要求有效 s/out 指针。出栈不会清零底层存储，count 之外的旧值无效。主例未进入失败分支。","f0":{"frame_id":"f0","line":22,"operation":"初始化空栈","popped":null,"top":null,"values":[]},"f1":{"frame_id":"f1","line":24,"operation":"push(3)","popped":null,"top":3,"values":[3]},"f2":{"frame_id":"f2","line":25,"operation":"push(8)","popped":null,"top":8,"values":[3,8]},"f3":{"frame_id":"f3","line":26,"operation":"pop()","popped":8,"top":3,"values":[3]},"f4":{"frame_id":"f4","line":27,"operation":"push(5)","popped":null,"top":5,"values":[3,5]},"lifo":"最近仍在栈中的入栈元素先出栈；本例先入 3 后入 8，第一次出栈取 8，3 留在栈中。","order":"程序以 data[0..count) 保存有效元素。数组按栈底到栈顶，非空时栈顶为 data[count-1]。","pop":"pop 先查空栈，再减小 count，将原栈顶通过 *out 写入调用者变量，返回 true。","push":"push 先查满栈，再把新值写到 data[count]、增加 count，返回 true。"},"main":{"frames":[{"frame_id":"f0","line":22,"operation":"初始化空栈","popped":null,"top":null,"values":[]},{"frame_id":"f1","line":24,"operation":"push(3)","popped":null,"top":3,"values":[3]},{"frame_id":"f2","line":25,"operation":"push(8)","popped":null,"top":8,"values":[3,8]},{"frame_id":"f3","line":26,"operation":"pop()","popped":8,"top":3,"values":[3]},{"frame_id":"f4","line":27,"operation":"push(5)","popped":null,"top":5,"values":[3,5]}],"source":"#include <stdbool.h>
#include <stddef.h>

enum { CAP = 3 };
typedef struct { int data[CAP]; size_t count; } Stack;

static bool push(Stack *s, int value) {
    if (s->count == CAP) return false;
    s->data[s->count] = value;
    ++s->count;
    return true;
}

static bool pop(Stack *s, int *out) {
    if (s->count == 0) return false;
    --s->count;
    *out = s->data[s->count];
    return true;
}

int main(void) {
    Stack s = {{0}, 0};
    int value;
    if (!push(&s, 3)) return 1;
    if (!push(&s, 8)) return 1;
    if (!pop(&s, &value)) return 1;
    if (!push(&s, 5)) return 1;
    return 0;
}
